{
  "version": "26.11.1-dev.11",
  "notes": "Reacher CM Dev 26.11.1-dev.11, a pre-release built from the fork's main.\n\nNew since v26.11.1-dev.10:\n\n- More preferences sync by default\n- DevOps tab in New session\n- Fewer sidebar buttons\n- Container hosts, database connections and Ansible/OpenTofu projects in the Sessions list\n- Organization vaults on iOS and Android\n- Managed Sync vault access\n- Sync location starts on the Reacher CM account\n- VeNCrypt for VNC sessions\n- DevOps workspaces open as tabs, from the Sessions list\n- Each person's own login in shared vaults\n- My default SSH key\n- Sync, Account and Backup settings reorganised\n- Keys to switch tabs\n- FTP/SFTP/SCP file sessions and the full-pane file manager on phones and tablets\n- Better on Samsung DeX\n- Notification position, history and system notifications\n- Byobu and Zellij\n- Keys no longer repeat by themselves on remote desktops\n- QR code scanning on Android phones without Google\n- Shorter tmux session name\n- Missing session log folders\n- Sync more application preferences\n- Choose which preferences sync on each device\n- Sign in to Account Sync from setup\n- iDRAC VNC on phones and tablets\n\niPhone and iPad: add https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rsipka/ReacherCM/update-feed/apps.json as a source in LiveContainer to get updates.\nFull list of changes: https://github.com/rsipka/ReacherCM/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
